`[[[ project_name ]]]` requires Python [[[ minimum_python ]]] or later (see [Compatibility and versioning](../project/compatibility-and-versioning.md)).

`[[[ project_name ]]]` is available from [PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/[[[ project_name ]]]/).
